# Copy to app/.env.local for local development (expo start reads it automatically).
# These are EXPO_PUBLIC_* on purpose — they ship in the client bundle and are
# public-safe because RLS is the security boundary (same model as the web app).
# Native builds get these from eas.json per-profile env instead.
